              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A lift? (مصعد, miṣʿad.) A corridor? (ممر, mamarr.) A public square? (ميدان, maydān.) An airport? (مطار, maṭār.) A port? (ميناء, mīnāʾ.) A neighbourhood? (حي, ḥayy.) An alley? (زقاق, zuqāq.) A building? (مبنى, mabnā.) A bathroom? (حمام, ḥammām.) A balcony? (شرفة, shurfa.) A roof? (سطح, saṭḥ.) Stairs? (درج, daraj.) A ceiling? (سقف, saqf.) Behind? (خلف, khalfa.) Between? (بين, bayna.) Beside? (بجانب, bi-jānib.) Left? (يسار, yasār.) The middle? (وسط, wasaṭ.) A corner? (زاوية, zāwiya.) North? (شمال, shamāl.) South? (جنوب, janūb.) East? (شرق, sharq.) West? (غرب, gharb.) A place? (مكان, makān.) An address? (عنوان, ʿunwān.)"
